@baseUrl = http://localhost:5130

### 1. Process normal payment (Success)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "ACC-1001",
  "amount": 150.00,
  "currency": "USD"
}

### 2. Configure gateway for Transient Failure (Fails twice, succeeds on 3rd attempt via Polly Retry)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/gateway-behavior?behavior=TransientFailure

### 3. Process payment with Transient Failure (Recovers via Polly Retry)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "ACC-1002",
  "amount": 200.00,
  "currency": "USD"
}

### 4. Configure gateway for Permanent Failure
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/gateway-behavior?behavior=PermanentFailure

### 5. Process payment with Permanent Failure (Polly Fallback kicks in safely)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "ACC-1003",
  "amount": 500.00,
  "currency": "USD"
}

### 6. Configure gateway for Timeout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/gateway-behavior?behavior=Timeout

### 7. Process payment with Timeout (Polly Timeout & Fallback kick in)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "ACC-1004",
  "amount": 75.00,
  "currency": "USD"
}

### 8. Check gateway status & attempts count
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/status
Accept: application/json
